BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Strictly Vinyl Basement Party - HOT STACKS - June 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T023000
UID:blogto-236709@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/18/original_image27c329df-2314-4bac-acd5-4f00b93f7a
 8d.jpg
DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing the vibes back to the basement where it all w
 here it all started.\nBrown Eyes Entertainment & STFDJs present\nHOT STACK
 S - A Strictly Vinyl Basement Party\nFriday\, June 26\, 2026\nFirst off 
 — thank you to everyone who came out and made our March edition of HOT S
 TACKS a SOLD OUT one. The energy in the room was unreal. From start to fin
 ish\, it was a reminder of what this party is really about.\nAnd now… we
  run it back.\nHOT STACKS is a strictly vinyl party dedicated to the music
 \, the culture\, and the energy that only records can bring. No laptops. N
 o shortcuts. Just dope DJs\, real crates\, and timeless sounds.\nExpect a 
 carefully curated selection of Hip Hop\, R&B\, and Reggae — from classic
  foundation joints to modern cuts that still respect the artform. This is 
 for the heads who appreciate warm sound\, dusty drums\, and heavy bassline
 s.\nOn Friday\, June 26\, Sweet Touch Foundation teams up with Mista Jiggz
  once again to take over BSMT 254 — an intimate\, underground space that
  perfectly matches the energy of this party. Expect close quarters\, sweat
 y vibes\, heads nodding\, and that unmistakable feeling of being locked in
 to the moment.\nThis isn’t a big-room club night.\nThis is a basement ja
 m.\nA place where the music comes first.\nIf you missed the last one\, don
 ’t make that mistake again.\nIf you were there\, you already know what t
 ime it is.\n🎶 Music: Hip Hop • R&B • Reggae (all eras)\n📍 Venue:
  BSMT 254\n📅 Date: Friday\, June 26 | 10PM\n🎟️ Advance tickets ava
 ilable here - https://hotstacksjune2026.eventbrite.com/?aff=BT\nBSMT 254 i
 s a live music and DJ venue with top ranked sound that specializes in intr
 oducing the people of Toronto to music they should really get down with.\n
 bsmt254.com | browneyesentertainment.com\nFor more info.\, email: connect@
 bsmt254.com\, info@browneyesentertainment.com\, or call 416.801.6325
LOCATION:BSMT 254
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/a-strictly-vinyl-basement-party-hot-stac
 ks-june-2026-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
