BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Celebrate the Rainbow with SKITTLES at Pride Toronto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T200000
UID:blogto-236698@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/17/original_image3c8aa992-781a-4313-a825-4a2c526491
 97.jpg
DESCRIPTION:This Pride\, SKITTLES® invites Canadians to Celebrate the Rai
 nbow with a high-energy\, immersive experience in the heart of Toronto's P
 ride festivities.\nFrom June 26–28\, SKITTLES® will transform Church St
 reet into a colourful community hub where visitors can enjoy dynamic live 
 entertainment\, connect with the community\, and help create meaningful im
 pact. The activation will feature live drag performances from local icons 
 Miss Moço and JayJay Kings\, alongside sets from queer DJs who will keep 
 the celebration going all weekend long. Guests can also enjoy complimentar
 y SKITTLES® samples throughout the experience.\nAt the centre of the acti
 vation is an interactive rainbow wall designed to capture the community's 
 collective voice. Festival-goers are invited to share what Pride means to 
 them on a custom lentil sticker and add it to the installation\, creating 
 a living mosaic that celebrates individuality\, inclusion\, and self-expre
 ssion.\nFor every lentil sticker added to the rainbow wall\, SKITTLES® wi
 ll donate $2 to Rainbow Railroad\, up to $15\,000\, helping support LGBTQI
 + individuals facing persecution around the world.\nJoin SKITTLES® on Chu
 rch Street to Celebrate the Rainbow and help turn collective celebration i
 nto lasting community impact.\nEVENT DATES & TIMES:\nLocation: Church Stre
 et\, Toronto Pride Festival\nTiming: Friday\, June 26 – Sunday\, June 28
 \nAdmission: Free and open to the public
LOCATION:Pride Toronto
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/celebrate-the-rainbow-with-skittles-at-p
 ride-toronto-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cheer Up Love: Its Love - A Pride Week Comedy Spectacular
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T223000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T000000
UID:blogto-236448@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/12/original_imagea98a9c62-7647-401f-bfa1-c2d9aff7a2
 66.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Forget the standard pride parades. Come get loud\, proud\, and
  absolutely STUNNING. To celebrate Pride Week in Toronto\, we’re taking 
 over Comedy Bar (Bloor) for a late-night show that’s as queer as it is c
 haotic.\nJoin hosts and co-producer Anu Kaur for an unapologetic showcase 
 featuring some of the city's sharpest queer voices. We’ve got a stacked 
 lineup ready to turn the volume up to eleven: Bee Bertrand\, Anesti Daneli
 s\, Ava Val\, Ester De Ville\, and Lou Habton.\nMost importantly\, a porti
 on of all ticket proceeds will be donated directly to The 519 to support t
 heir incredible work for the LGBTQ+ community in Toronto.\nWhen: June 26th
 \, Doors at 10:30pm\nWhere: Comedy Bar Bloor\nTickets: https://comedybar.c
 a/shows/cheer-up-love-its-love\nCome for the laughs\, stay for the cause. 
 Let’s pack the house\, support The 519\, and kick off your Pride celebra
 tions with a night you won't forget.
LOCATION:Comedy Bar
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/cheer-up-love-its-love-a-pride-week-come
 dy-spectacular-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
