 gto.com/events/2026/06/05/original_image9c2b1a96-ca15-4bc0-9e29-bc350a1f61
 d3.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by the luminous colours and expressive brushstrokes o
 f Impressionist Revolution: Monet to Matisse from the Dallas Museum of Art
 \, this AGO seasonal Afternoon Tea offers a leisurely escape into the worl
 d of Impressionism. Join with friends and family for an elegant afternoon 
 surrounded by art\, conversation and thoughtfully crafted flavours that re
 flect the beauty and softness of the exhibition.\nDelicate savoury selecti
 ons and whimsical pastries are designed to evoke sunlit gardens\, countrys
 ide picnics and the romance of Impressionism. Served with freshly baked sc
 ones\, preserves and tea\, the experience invites you to slow down and sav
 our the moment.\nCelebrates the connection between art\, atmosphere and in
 dulgence.
LOCATION:Art Gallery of Ontario
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/impressionist-afternoon-tea-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
