 Queer patrons.\nPatrons can also share their Queer books for others to rea
 d and make friends in a low-pressure environment.\nChill friends are welco
 me to come alone or with your crew as long as you are ready to get cozy.\n
 Patrons will get free themed vintage check-out cards\, as long as supplies
  last.\nJazz N’ Book will take place at Wildseed Centre for Art & Activi
 sm\, Second Floor.
