BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:June 2026 Sneaker Release Calendar Caitlin Clark Kobe 5 Protro Lea
 ds This Month Biggest Drops
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T110000
UID:blogto-236812@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/22/original_imagea6171a39-ddb3-4ac8-9886-194c0b8f35
 d5.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Caitlin Clark’s Nike Kobe 5 Protro Headlines June 2026’s B
 iggest Sneaker Releases\nSummer sneaker season is officially underway\, an
 d June 2026 is packed with highly anticipated releases. From premium colla
 borations to player-exclusive basketball sneakers\, the month offers somet
 hing for every type of collector. Leading the lineup is Caitlin Clark’s 
 latest Nike Kobe 5 Protro PE\, a release that has quickly become one of th
 e most talked-about drops of the year.\nNike Kobe 5 Protro x Caitlin Clark
  "Coconut Milk/Bright Spruce"\nRelease Date: June 2\, 2026\nRetail Price: 
 $190\nNike continues its partnership with WNBA superstar Caitlin Clark by 
 bringing another player-exclusive Kobe model to retail. The Kobe 5 Protro 
 "Coconut Milk/Bright Spruce" follows several successful Clark-inspired rel
 eases\, including her Rookie of the Year Kobe 5 Protro\, Indiana Fever-the
 med Kobe 5 Protro\, and Kobe 6 Protro colorways.\nDesigned by Eric Avar\, 
 the original Kobe 5 remains one of the most celebrated performance basketb
 all shoes ever created. The low-profile silhouette was inspired by Kobe Br
 yant’s passion for soccer and introduced a lightweight build combined wi
 th elite on-court responsiveness.\nFor the Protro version\, Nike updates t
 he classic model with modern performance technology while maintaining the 
 original look that made it a fan favorite. The sneaker features enhanced A
 ir Zoom cushioning\, improved responsiveness\, and refined traction patter
 ns designed to meet today’s performance standards.\nThe colorway arrives
  dressed in a clean Coconut Milk upper accented by Bright Spruce green det
 ails. A glossy finish gives the shoe a premium appearance\, helping it sta
 nd out both on and off the court. While fans are eagerly awaiting Clark’
 s first signature shoe\, this release keeps the spotlight on her growing i
 nfluence within Nike Basketball.\nAs one of the most recognizable athletes
  in basketball today\, Caitlin Clark’s connection to the Kobe line conti
 nues to generate significant excitement among sneaker collectors and baske
 tball fans alike.\nWith June packed full of major launches\, the Nike Kobe
  5 Protro x Caitlin Clark "Coconut Milk/Bright Spruce" stands out as one o
 f the month's most sought-after releases and a strong contender for sneake
 r of the summer.
LOCATION:June 2026 Sneaker Release Calendar Caitlin Clark Kobe 5 Protro Le
 ads This Month’s Biggest Drops
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/june-2026-sneaker-release-calendar-caitl
 in-clark-kobe-5-protro-leads-this-month-biggest-drops-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:King Arthur's Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T212300
UID:blogto-233618@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/14/original_image7f5bb43b-c8f5-4a67-bee1-b824b505c5
 cc.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by New World Theatre’s King Arthur’s Night\, whic
 h had its world premiere at Luminato Festival in 2017\, this genre-defying
  documentary film is rooted in a medieval musical play created by an extra
 ordinary company of artists living with and without Down syndrome.\nBlendi
 ng myth\, memory\, and music\, the film moves between an imagined Camelot 
 and the real-world reflections of its creators\, including Niall McNeil an
 d Marcus Youssef\, alongside director James Long and composer Veda Hille. 
 With humour and heart\, it weaves together childhood memories\, family rel
 ationships\, and fantastical characters into a story that is both playful 
 and deeply moving.\nCelebrating inclusive creation as a vital artistic lan
 guage\, King Arthur’s Night invites audiences into a shared cinematic ex
 perience that explores disability\, belonging\, and who gets to shape the 
 stories we inherit and pass on.
LOCATION:Hot Docs Ted Rogers Cinema
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/king-arthurs-night-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
