BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Low Sky Weekend: Troll 2 with Peter Kuplowsky
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T221500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T000000
UID:blogto-236856@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/23/original_image68b9baf8-3034-4eea-9600-919365a693
 04.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Screening in part of Low Sky Weekend\, a city-wide film series
  hosted by veteran curator (TIFF) and producer (In a Violent Nature) Peter
  Kuplowsky to announce his new film development company Low Sky Production
 s.\nA summer vacation turns into a feverish nightmare as a family find the
 mselves the intended main course for a clandestine cabal of shape-shifting
  vegetarian goblins with designs to transform people into vegetables! It's
  a wackadoo premise born from the mind of veteran Italian genre filmmakers
  Claudio Fragasso\, and executed with sublimely hilarious dissonance as th
 e production deployed a non-English speaking crew to wrangle its non-Itali
 an speaking cast of endearingly hapless American actors. Coronated as the 
 “BEST WORST MOVIE” by the critically acclaimed and award winning docum
 entary of the same name\, Troll 2 stands within a pantheon of “cult cine
 ma” that defies all traditional preconceived notions of form\, aesthetic
 s and taste\, and yet somehow cultivates one of the most entertaining and 
 baffling movie-going experiences of all time.\nFeaturing with an introduct
 ion by curator/producer Peter Kuplowsky.
LOCATION:Hot Docs Ted Rogers Cinema
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/low-sky-weekend-troll-2-with-peter-kuplo
 wsky-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
