BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nike Kobe Draft Day T-Shirt Collection Honors The 1996 NBA Draft
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T110000
UID:blogto-236809@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/22/original_image2ebec589-12f9-4c6b-a605-1006a50147
 ba.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Nike Kobe Draft Pack Blind Box T-Shirt Collection Releases Jun
 e 26\nNike continues to celebrate Kobe Bryant’s unforgettable 1996 NBA D
 raft journey with the second installment of its Kobe Draft Pack series. Fo
 llowing the sneaker release\, the brand is now introducing a blind box T-s
 hirt collection inspired by one of the most memorable draft-night stories 
 in basketball history.\nScheduled to launch on June 26\, 2026\, exclusivel
 y through Nike.com\, each T-shirt will retail for $60 and be available in 
 men's sizing.\nThe collection features a range of colorways inspired by th
 e first 13 teams that selected ahead of Bryant during the 1996 NBA Draft. 
 Although the Charlotte Hornets drafted Kobe\, his rights were quickly trad
 ed to the Los Angeles Lakers\, making both franchises central to the colle
 ction’s theme. In addition to team-inspired designs\, Nike has included 
 a special Lakers edition dressed in the franchise's iconic purple and gold
  colors.\nEvery shirt showcases a two-tone color scheme with oversized "KO
 BE" lettering across the chest\, styled to resemble classic team uniforms.
  A Draft Day patch appears on the lower left hem\, featuring graphics that
  connect directly to the Kobe 4 Draft Day Pack footwear release.\nAdding t
 o the excitement\, each T-shirt arrives in sealed gold packaging that conc
 eals the colorway inside. The blind box format creates a collectible exper
 ience\, reflecting the uncertainty and anticipation surrounding draft nigh
 t itself. With multiple possible team-inspired designs available\, buyers 
 won't know which version they receive until the package is opened.\nThe Ni
 ke Kobe Draft Pack Blind Box T-Shirt Collection releases on June 26\, 2026
 . Fans of Kobe Bryant and sneaker culture alike can look forward to adding
  a unique piece of basketball history to their collection.
LOCATION:Nike Kobe Draft Day T-Shirt Collection Honors The 1996 NBA Draft
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/nike-kobe-draft-day-t-shirt-collection-h
 onors-the-1996-nba-draft-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
