BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Troll 2 - with Peter Kuplowsky
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T221500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T000000
UID:blogto-236620@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/16/original_image15c14245-17f0-4378-b07e-bd61616b8c
 8e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Screening in part of Low Sky Weekend\, a city-wide film series
  hosted by veteran curator (TIFF) and producer (In a Violent Nature) Peter
  Kuplowsky to announce his new film development company Low Sky Production
 s. Please click here for more details.\nA summer vacation turns into a fev
 erish nightmare as a family find themselves the intended main course for a
  clandestine cabal of shape-shifting vegetarian goblins with designs to tr
 ansform people into vegetables! It's a wackadoo premise born from the mind
  of veteran Italian genre filmmakers Claudio Fragasso\, and executed with 
 sublimely hilarious dissonance as the production deployed a non-English sp
 eaking crew to wrangle its non-Italian speaking cast of endearingly haples
 s American actors. Coronated as the “BEST WORST MOVIE” by the critical
 ly acclaimed and award winning documentary of the same name\, Troll 2 stan
 ds within a pantheon of “cult cinema” that defies all traditional prec
 onceived notions of form\, aesthetics and taste\, and yet somehow cultivat
 es one of the most entertaining and baffling movie-going experiences of al
 l time.\nFeaturing with an introduction by curator/producer Peter Kuplowsk
 y.
LOCATION:Hot Docs Ted Rogers Cinema
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/troll-2-with-peter-kuplowsky-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Victory - Presented by the ICFF Festival at the Distillery Distric
 t
