BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Anga's Farm: How to Create a Pollinator Garden Seminar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T140000
UID:blogto-236680@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/17/original_image5404bb5a-9beb-4982-a05f-7e77e4a6eb
 68.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Seminar: How to Create a Pollinator Garden\nCelebrate Pollinat
 or Week with us at Anga’s Farm & Nursery! Supporting pollinators isn’t
  just something we talk about\, it’s something we live every day with ou
 r own bees thriving right here on the farm.\nAs both a garden centre and b
 eekeepers\, we understand on every level how important pollinators are and
  how vital it is to provide the right nectar and pollen sources throughout
  the growing season. This informative seminar will cover the basics of how
  to create a successful pollinator garden\, whether you have a large backy
 ard\, a small garden bed\, or even just a balcony with containers.\nWe’l
 l talk about pollinator-friendly plant selection\, how to create continuou
 s blooms throughout the season\, and simple ways to support bees\, butterf
 lies\, and other beneficial insects in your own space. We’ll also be dis
 cussing native plants and why incorporating them into your garden is so im
 portant for supporting healthy pollinator populations and creating resilie
 nt ecosystems.\nEven if you don’t have traditional garden space\, we’l
 l also go over how to successfully grow pollinator plants in containers an
 d patio planters.\nGuests will also enjoy:\nA tour of our pollinator garde
 n\nA chance to learn more about the bees here at the farm\nA tasting of ou
 r own farm honey\nA fun\, educational\, and inspiring seminar for anyone l
 ooking to garden with more purpose while helping support local pollinators
 .\nVisit our website for more details & to sign up! www.angasfarm.ca
LOCATION:Anga's Farm & Nursery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/angas-farm-how-to-create-a-pollinator-ga
 rden-seminar-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
