 servationist. Alan Li uses pencils and paint to document the wonders of th
 e natural world. Alan’s mission is to build connections to nature throug
 h art-based education.\nHis past workshops at Gwartzman's include: Silverp
 oint drawing\, Printing with Walnut Ink\, Subway Sketching\, and Linout pr
 inting.\nOverview:\n📔Guided instruction\n📔All materials provided\n
 📔Perfect for journalers\n📔Take home a custom notebook and stamp!
