 gto.com/events/2026/06/07/original_image8010a551-aa07-4d3f-bbc6-ff406c6408
 a6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Toronto's best ALL vinyl reggae & dancehall basement party lik
 e no other!!! Happens on the last Saturday of each and every month at BSMT
 254.\nLast Saturday of each and every month means its DUTTY time again\, a
 nd this month we welcome DJ SHAI to join CHOPPA CHOP behind the turntables
 .\nDJ SHAI has been bringing the heat when it comes to reggae & dancehall 
 music in Toronto for years without fears!Under the IREMEMBER handle SHAI h
 as helped bring artistes like CHRONIXX\, KABAKA PYRAMID\, PROTOJE & JAH9 t
