SUMMARY:Miami And Marlins Find This Dog Dream Day At Loandepot Park Shirt
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T150000
UID:blogto-236936@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/24/original_imagec7de4f30-414f-4382-8d96-15b03a1717
 7a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Marlins had quite a crowd on hand for Monday night’s Vis
 it Our Official here <a href="https://www.bonfire.com/miami-and-marlins-fi
 nd-this-dog-dream-day-at/">miami and marlins find this dog dream day at lo
 andepot park shirt</a> game against the Rangers at loanDepot park\, includ
 ing the Tartan Army of Scottish football supporters making the rounds with
  the World Cup taking place in Miami. That crowd also featured a bevy of f
 our-legged friends.\nAt the Marlins’ “Bark at the Park” night\, dogs
  around the stadium were treated to an exciting game on the diamond. And o
 ff the diamond\, the treats included an iconic ballpark hot dog\, at least
  for one lucky pup whose owners shared the end of their frank.\nGuayabera 
 Day is July 7!\nAnother dog sitting one row back\, however\, was not so lu
 cky. The Miami broadcast caught the moment the first dog munched on its sn
 ack\, while the second dog looked on with what can only be described as th
 e pure embodiment of disappointment and jealousy. Just look at that face\,
  with as human-like an expression as dogs are likely capable of.\nFortunat
 ely for our down-and-out canine\, all’s well that ends well. The Marlins
  caught wind of this viral moment and have put out a social media request 
 for help finding the dog\, using a hilarious “Wanted” ad with a freeze
  frame of the dog’s melancholy mug.\nThe reward? “A dream day at loanD
 epot park.”
LOCATION:Multiple Venues
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/miami-and-marlins-find-this-dog-dream-da
 y-at-loandepot-park-shirt-toronto/
