 gto.com/events/2026/04/07/original_image36e80c07-0253-4a57-ba96-22325250ca
 97.jpg
DESCRIPTION:12)	Gentileschi Baroque Ensemble is a dynamic period instrumen
 t ensemble dedicated to uncovering and performing the extraordinary music 
 of women composers from the Baroque era. Echo Chamber presents Five Postca
 rds from Canada\, a vivid musical journey across the country through works
  by leading Canadian composers Marjan Mozetich\, Carmen Braden\, Derek Cha
 rke\, Alice Ho\, and James Rolfe. Each piece offers a distinct sonic “po
 stcard\,” reflecting the diverse landscapes\, cultures\, and artistic vo
 ices that shape Canada’s musical identity. Taking place in the Aperture 
 Room\, a light filled space on the top floor of a beautifully restored bui
 lding just north of Yonge and Dundas Square\, each COSE event will be as m
 uch a social gathering as it will be an opportunity for musical discovery.
 \nInfo: 416-214-1660\n$40 (3-ticket COSE pass: $100)
LOCATION:Aperture Room
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/music-toronto-cose-celebration-of-small-
 ensembles-echo-chamber-gentileschi-baroque-ensemble-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MY HOUSE JUNCTION JAZZ FEST 2026: GENEVIEVE MARENTETTE'S FLUX STAT
 E
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T230000
UID:blogto-236285@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/09/original_imagef007a0e3-c15a-479f-a18c-1cb607de8f
 f0.jpg
DESCRIPTION:MY HOUSE JUNCTION JAZZ FEST 2026: GENEVIEVE MARENTETTE'S FLUX 
 STATE\nAll Fest Tickets: www.eventbrite.com/cc/4844128\n@ My HOUSE\, 2882 
 Dundas St. West\, Toronto\, 416-604-4555\nJune 22 to 28 -- 7 days of the n
 ation's best jazz musicians in the Junction's own My HOUSE!\nFrom Press Re
 lease:\nToronto's My HOUSE in the Junction live music venue & restaurant h
 as again teamed up with Brooklyn\, NY's Browntasauras Records -- who has a
  studio in the Junction -- to bring you some of the best jazz in the count
 ry from June 22 to 28. This year again features Artist-In-Residence BROWNM
 AN ALI as the fest's Artistic Director\, up from Brooklyn\, NY. This 10x G
 lobal Music Award winner\, 12x JUNO Award nominee & GRAMMY Award long-list
 er will be on stage every night during the festival as either a sideman or
  a leader\, and has hand-picked all the top-tier musicians & award-winning
  ensembles involved in the 2nd annual My HOUSE Junction Jazz Fest featurin
 g classic jazz\, modern jazz\, latin-jazz\, electric-jazz and more! Come t
 o My HOUSE in the Junction this June 22 to 28 for 7 nights of an unforgett
 able jazz experience!\n----\nAll Fest Tickets: www.eventbrite.com/cc/48441
 28\n----\nFEST SCHEDULE AT-A-GLANCE -->\nMon-Jun-22\, 7pm: JORDANA TALSKY:
  LIVE LOOPING\nTue-Jun-23\, 7pm: JACOB WUTZKE TRIO\nWed-Jun-24\, 7pm: NICK
  MACLEAN 4-TET play HERBIE HANCOCK\nThr-Jun-25\, 7pm: ARECIBO - Proyecto B
 lanquito\nFri-Jun-26\, 8pm: BROWNMAN ELECTRYC TRIO\nSat-Jun-27\, 8pm: GENE
 VIEVE MARENTETTE's FLUX-STATE\nSun-Jun-28\, 4pm: MILES DAVIS: The PRESTIGE
  YEARS\n----\nAll Fest Tickets: www.eventbrite.com/cc/4844128\n----\nSat-J
 un-27\, 8:00pm\, $25 adv / $35 door\nGENEVIEVE MARENTETTE's FLUX-STATE\nVo
 cal-driven Electric-jazz\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/1990305434131\nFLUX-
 STATE is music before it hardens into form. Led by the extraordinary inter
 nationally acclaimed improvising vocalist Genevieve “Gigi” Marentette 
 -- backed by the GRAMMY long-listed Brownman Electryc Trio plus the JUNO n
 ominated Nick Maclean -- this group turns chords\, grooves\, lyrics\, and 
 original compositions into spontaneous songcraft. Gigi utilizes pre-writte
 n words\, while inventing melodie in real time over music that is alive\, 
 unstable\, courageous\, and never the same twice. This is modern jazz in i
 ts most creative flux-state. Not to be missed!\n:: Genevieve Marentette - 
 vocals\n:: Brownman Ali - trumpet\n:: Nick Maclean - keys & synths\n:: Sea
 n Dennis - 6-string electric bass\n:: Adam Mansfield - drums\nwww.Geneviev
 eMarentette.com
LOCATION:My House
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/my-house-junction-jazz-fest-2026-genevie
 ve-marentettes-flux-state-toronto/
