 5b.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to rock out with Muzic Souljah and Slit Personality 
 dropping beats all night long!\nMUZIC SOULJAH is a veteran of the Toronto 
 live music scene. He was known back in the day as Robbie D. Licious - fron
 t man for a powerhouse 14-piece Funk / RnB band that was a fixture at the 
 legendary BamBoo Club on Queen West.\nThese days\, he fronts Toronto’s s
 moothest and rudest foundation reggae band\, SPLIT PERSONALITY - a 7-piece
  ensemble of musicians of the highest order\, who have been making a serio
 us mark on our local scene over for the last few years.\nWe’re thrilled 
 to have them for this instalment of our monthly live reggae series\, where
  they’re certain to sound their best\, on our top ranked sound system\, 
 controlled by world-class sound engineers.Doors open at 8pm\, and the perf
 ormance starts at 9pm SHARP!It should also be noted that the concert will 
 be followed by an all-vinyl DJ party that all attendees are welcome\, and 
 encouraged\, to stick around for.\nSupport by City of Toronto's Music Offi
 ce\nBSMT 254 is a live music and DJ venue with top ranked sound that speci
 alizes in introducing the people of Toronto to music they should really ge
 t down with.\nWebsite: www.bsmt254.com\nInstagram: @bsmt254toronto\nEmail:
  connect@bsmt254.com
LOCATION:BSMT254
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/saturday-night-rockers-toronto/
