  night experience where the party is part of the performances and the perf
 ormances are part of the party. Simultaneously\, the event series has beco
 me the most affordable pride party in the country\, ensuring that pride al
 ways remains accessible.\nThis year's event will begin with a special trib
 ute to Michelle Ross: the late Jamaican-Canadian drag queen who paved the 
 way for a generation of Black performers and transformed the face of the T
 oronto's Gay Village in the 80s/90s.
