 artisan vendors and much more. It is sure to be a delicious and scenic set
 ting where you can wind down after all the excitement of the Pride parade 
 and enjoy some of Toronto’s most delicious offerings! \n\nBALDWIN VILLA
 GE FESTIVAL\n11am to 11pm\, June 28\, 2026\nBaldwin Street between McCaul 
 and Beverly\n\nPARTCIPATING PARTNERS:\nAlfies (NEW!)\nButter & Blue\nCarbo
 nic Coffee\nJ&G Chicken (NEW!)\nKoh Lipe \nLarb Muang\nLHAO Thai-Chinese 
 (NEW!)\nLight Cafe\nMexhico\nOmai Rice Bar (NEW!)\nPepper meets Pepper (NE
 W!)\nPetite Lune (NEW!)\nRooms Coffee\nStreet Grill\nThe Sweet Spot\nTiger
  Den\nYunnan Noodle Shack\nYuugi Izakaya\nWNDRLND (fashion)\nLychuu Lychuu
  (events)\n
