 gto.com/events/2026/06/07/original_imaged8ebf107-3e49-40dd-9e45-e51191e61d
 a9.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Pollinator Week with a Rooftop Beekeeping Experience
  at Samara Brewery!\njoin Rae\, co-founder of Bickford Beekeeping Co-Opera
 tive for a rooftop beekeeping experience followed by a pint in the brewhou
 se!\nenjoy the magic of a honey bee hive with an experienced\, passionate 
 urban beekeeper. Rae will walk you through beehive basics\, while showcasi
 ng the gentle nature of one of our city's pollinators. You will have the o
 pportunity to meet the bees\, see the queen\, and have a hands-on experien
 ce with the colony if you want!\nyour first drink is included in your tick
 et price. non-alcoholic beverages are also available at the brewery.\n*thi
 s event is weather dependant. in the case of inclement weather\, the event
  will be rescheduled with advanced notice. if the new date/time does not w
 ork for you\, a full refund will be issued.\n*if you are underage or a non
 -drinker\, please email admin@bickfordbees.co for ticket options
LOCATION:Samara Brewing Co.
