BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Good Behaviour x Dog Standards - Dog Ice Cream Launch Event
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T160000
UID:blogto-236689@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/17/original_imagee7e4e99f-054d-4d31-8552-4482f722f8
 b1.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Good Behaviour and Dog Standards will host a launch event at G
 ood Behaviour\, 342 Westmoreland Ave N\, Toronto\, on Sunday\, June 28 fro
 m 12–4 p.m. The afternoon includes sampling\, swag bags\, dog tag engrav
 ing\, adoptable dogs with Toronto Humane Society\, and more.\nGood Behavio
 ur is partnering with Toronto-based fresh dog food company Dog Standards t
 o launch ice cream for dogs\, a dairy-free\, dog-safe frozen treat handcra
 fted so owners can finally share a cone with their pets without the health
  risks.\n"On a hot summer day\, dog parents' first instinct is to share a 
 lick of their ice cream cone\, but this can be more harmful than they real
 ize. Many dogs are lactose intolerant\, and ice cream is typically high in
  sugar and fat. Ingredients like chocolate and xylitol are also extremely 
 toxic for dogs\," said Jessica Bevilacqua\, Founder of Dog Standards.\n"We
  wanted to work with Good Behaviour\, a local brand that shares the same p
 roduction standards\, so dog parents could still share in the joy of ice c
 ream together\, but in a safer and more nutritious way\," added Bevilacqua
 .\nThe dog ice cream is dairy-free\, using coconut cream as the base with 
 pumpkin\, banana\, and peanut butter inclusions. Every batch is manufactur
 ed in Good Behaviour's production facility in Toronto.
LOCATION:Good Behaviour
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/good-behaviour-x-dog-standards-dog-ice-c
 ream-launch-event-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Killdozer Merch
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T110000
UID:blogto-237004@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/25/original_imagebba7403f-6110-4913-8a81-ecc9dbf263
 fe.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Interest in Killdozer merch is growing as more people discover
  the fascinating story behind one of the most discussed engineering-relate
 d events in modern American history. The rise of online communities\, soci
 al media discussions\, and documentary content has helped introduce new au
 diences to the story\, leading to increased demand for themed apparel and 
 collectibles. Our Official Collection Here https://www.bonfire.com/killdoz
 er-merch/\nAmong the most popular items are the Killdozer T Shirt\, Killdo
 zer Shirt\, and Killdozer Hoodie\, which have become favorites among fans 
 who appreciate historical events\, heavy machinery\, and unique cultural s
 tories. Designers have responded to the growing demand by creating a wide 
 variety of graphics featuring detailed illustrations\, blueprint-inspired 
 artwork\, and bold typography that celebrates the legendary machine.\nOnli
 ne retailers report that interest in niche historical apparel continues to
  expand as consumers seek clothing that reflects their personal interests 
 and hobbies. Killdozer-themed merchandise fits perfectly within this trend
 \, offering fans a way to showcase their appreciation for a story that con
 tinues to spark debate and discussion years after the original event.\nMan
 y of the latest designs feature rugged industrial aesthetics\, vintage dis
 tressed prints\, and artistic interpretations of the armored bulldozer. Th
 e Killdozer T Shirt remains a top choice for casual everyday wear\, while 
 the Killdozer Shirt is often selected by collectors looking for unique add
 itions to their wardrobe. For colder seasons\, the Killdozer Hoodie has be
 come especially popular due to its combination of comfort and eye-catching
  artwork.\nThe continued success of documentaries\, podcasts\, and online 
 video content has helped maintain public interest in the story. As more pe
 ople learn about the engineering modifications and historical background\,
  merchandise inspired by the event continues to attract attention across m
 ultiple age groups.\nIndustry observers note that niche-themed apparel mar
 kets remain strong\, particularly when connected to stories that inspire c
 uriosity and discussion. As a result\, Killdozer merchandise is expected t
 o remain a popular category for enthusiasts who enjoy history\, engineerin
 g\, and distinctive graphic apparel.
LOCATION:Multiple Venues
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/killdozer-merch-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
