BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MY HOUSE JUNCTION JAZZ FEST 2026: MILES DAVIS - PRESTIGE YEARS fea
 t. Brownman Ali
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T190000
UID:blogto-236286@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/09/original_image1bc326ae-961f-434e-8edd-528c4dc9c4
 2f.jpg
DESCRIPTION:MY HOUSE JUNCTION JAZZ FEST 2026: MILES DAVIS - PRESTIGE YEARS
  feat. Brownman Ali\nAll Fest Tickets: www.eventbrite.com/cc/4844128\n@ My
  HOUSE\, 2882 Dundas St. West\, Toronto\, 416-604-4555\nJune 22 to 28 -- 7
  days of the nation's best jazz musicians in the Junction's own My HOUSE!\
 nFrom Press Release:\nToronto's My HOUSE in the Junction live music venue 
 & restaurant has again teamed up with Brooklyn\, NY's Browntasauras Record
 s -- who has a studio in the Junction -- to bring you some of the best jaz
 z in the country from June 22 to 28. This year again features Artist-In-Re
 sidence BROWNMAN ALI as the fest's Artistic Director\, up from Brooklyn\, 
 NY. This 10x Global Music Award winner\, 12x JUNO Award nominee & GRAMMY A
 ward long-lister will be on stage every night during the festival as eithe
 r a sideman or a leader\, and has hand-picked all the top-tier musicians &
  award-winning ensembles involved in the 2nd annual My HOUSE Junction Jazz
  Fest featuring classic jazz\, modern jazz\, latin-jazz\, electric-jazz an
 d more! Come to My HOUSE in the Junction this June 22 to 28 for 7 nights o
 f an unforgettable jazz experience!\n----\nAll Fest Tickets: www.eventbrit
 e.com/cc/4844128\n----\nFEST SCHEDULE AT-A-GLANCE -->\nMon-Jun-22\, 7pm: J
 ORDANA TALSKY: LIVE LOOPING\nTue-Jun-23\, 7pm: JACOB WUTZKE TRIO\nWed-Jun-
 24\, 7pm: NICK MACLEAN 4-TET play HERBIE HANCOCK\nThr-Jun-25\, 7pm: ARECIB
 O - Proyecto Blanquito\nFri-Jun-26\, 8pm: BROWNMAN ELECTRYC TRIO\nSat-Jun-
 27\, 8pm: GENEVIEVE MARENTETTE's FLUX-STATE\nSun-Jun-28\, 4pm: MILES DAVIS
 : The PRESTIGE YEARS\n----\nAll Fest Tickets: www.eventbrite.com/cc/484412
 8\n----\nSun-Jun-28 (matinee)\, 4:00pm\, $20 adv / $30 door\nMILES DAVIS: 
 PRESTIGE YEARS feat. Brownman Ali\nClassic jazz\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca
 /e/1990305482275\nHailed as “one of the greatest interpreters of Miles D
 avis' work in Canada” (Hamilton Spectator)\, multi award-winning trumpet
  iconoclast Brownman Ali explores Miles' work from '51 to '56\, where a st
 ring of groundbreaking albums for Prestige Records would be recorded\, inc
 luding Cookin’\, Relaxin’\, Workin’\, and Steamin’ -- blending beb
 op virtuosity with a cool\, lyrical sensibility. Brownman and a selection 
 of top-shelf jazz artists will explore these recordings channeling the int
 ensity and innovation of Miles’ early genius.\n:: Brownman Ali - trumpet
 \n:: Nick Maclean - piano\n:: Bennett Young - bass\n:: Frank Botos - drums
 \nwww.AkousticTrio.Brownman.com
LOCATION:My House
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/my-house-junction-jazz-fest-2026-miles-d
 avis-prestige-years-feat-brownman-ali-toronto/
