BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pride Month Closing Event
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T230000
UID:blogto-237039@blogto.com
DESCRIPTION:Pride doesn’t end when the parade does! Right at the Parade 
 terminus\, in Nathan Phillips Square\, local DJ legends will be spinning s
 o you can dance the day away from 2PM – 6PM. Then it’s all about live 
 music with singers and bands taking over the TD Main Stage from 6PM – 11
 PM for a massive show that you won’t want to miss! Featuring the best To
 ronto has to offer\, spanning pop\, rock\, rap and latin music. Followed b
 y three cutting edge musicians in Austra\, Tanya Tagaq\, and Gloria Groove
 .\n\nAustra is a Canadian composer\, electronic producer and singer best k
 nown for her ethereal voice and genre-blending sound. Over the past decade
  and a half she’s released five albums and has played sold out shows aro
 und the world. Her 2025 synth-pop album\, Chin Up Buttercup was one of the
  best reviewed albums of the year!\n\nFrom Ikaluktutiak\, internationally 
 celebrated artist Tanya Tagaq is an improvisational throat singer\, avant-
 garde composer and bestselling author. A member of the Order of Canada\, P
 olaris Music Prize and JUNO Award winner and recipient of multiple honorar
 y doctorates\, Tagaq is an original disruptor\, a world-changing figure at
  the forefront of seismic social\, political and environmental change.\n\n
 Gloria Groove is one of Brazil’s most streamed pop artists. She began he
 r career as a Drag Queen in 2015 and since released 3 albums\, collaborati
 ng with artists like DJ GBR\, Anitta\, and Pabllo Vittar. In 2024 she embr
 aced pagode live albums\, Serenata da GG\, which included the viral hit 
 “Nosso Primeiro Beijo.” Transcending genres and boundaries\, Gloria Gr
 oove stands as one of today’s greatest artists.\n\nSet times:\nBR House 
 @ 2:00PM\nJENNER @ 4:00PM\nRAXX @ 6:00PM\nCarina @ 6:40PM\nNanu @ 7:20PM\n
 Austra @ 8:00PM\nTanya Tagaq @ 9:00PM\nGloria Groove @ 10:00PM
LOCATION:Nathan Phillips Square
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/pride-month-closing-event-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
