 gto.com/events/2026/06/11/original_image82fde7ac-e3b7-47fd-b454-073eabdf74
 e1.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Be part of Canada's longest running Drag Brunch this PRIDE SUN
 DAY at Piano Piano on Bloor West.\nIt's our PRIDE SUNDAY Edition of Glad D
 ay's famous DRAG BRUNCH!\nwith your host SELENA VYLE\nand her guest MAHARL
 I\nEvery week Glad Day serves you more than you can handle and you eat it 
 up! A different guest each week\, delicious brunch and a vibe you won't ge
 t anywhere else.\nIt's a must-see if you are visiting Toronto!\nGreat for 
 birthdays and other celebrations.\nRemember to bring your $5s and $10s to 
 tip the performers.\nARRIVAL TIMES\nTickets have an arrival time of:\n11:1
 5am OR 11:45am\nShow begins at 12pm\nThe different arrival times help ensu
 re you get the attention and speed you deserve. Big groups mayhave differe
 nt arrival times - but you will still all be sat together (when possible\,
  see below).\n11:15am - First Wave of seating\n11:45am - Second Wave of se
 ating\n12pm - Show begins\n1:30pm - Show ends\nThe cost for the show is $1
 4.95 or less per seat.\nDrinks and food are not included in this show fee.
 \nAll ticket revenue goes to support the performers and the non-profit wor
 k of Glad Day Lit!\nHOW DO I BOOK A TABLE FOR A GROUP?\nThe best way to bo
 ok a group of 7 or more is to email vip@gladday.ca. You will get discounte
 d tickets and we can confirm if there is enough space for you to all be at
  one large table or one area.\nIf your group is 6 people or less\, you can
  just purchase enough tickets for your group. All tickets under the same n
 ame will be sat togher.\n(for example: a group of 5 could be one table of 
 three and one table of two\; a group of 6 could be one table of four and t
 wo add-a-seats\; a group of 4 could be two tables of two if the tables of 
 4 are sold out)\nNOTE: Many of these brunches sell out 4-7 days in advance
 . If you are booking for a group less than 1 week in advance\, you might n
 ot all be at the same table\, but we will ensure you are near each other. 
 Email vip@gladday.ca if you have any questions or need confirmations.\nThe
 re are no age restrictions - all ages can attend.\nIf you have any special
  table requests or questions\, you can email: vip@gladday.ca\nIf booking a
  table through Eventbrite is a barrier\, you can also email vip@gladday.ca
  for other payment options.
LOCATION:Piano Piano Bloor
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/pride-sunday-drag-brunch-in-toronto-toro
 nto/
