UID:blogto-235042@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/14/original_imagedf23e6e6-47ff-4445-84ec-459247af6d
 19.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Explore art\, politics and consciousness through the improbabl
 e life of Michael Clegg\, the former Catholic priest who introduced MDMA t
 o the world—a drug he would later dub "Ecstasy." Prophet of Ecstasy take
 s viewers on a wild ride\, from Clegg’s life as an MDMA drug kingpin to 
 his present-day transformation as an enlightened yogi. It also examines ho
 w the destinies of Michael Clegg\, chemist Carina Leveriza\, and psychedel
 ics advocate Rick Doblin\, are inexorably bound with that of the socio-cul
 tural explosion of MDMA through its epic journey of discovery\, criminaliz
 ation\, and re-emergence from the shadows.\nJoin film subject Rick Doblin 
 for a special post-screening Q&A.\nRick Doblin\, Ph.D.\, is the Founder an
 d President of the Multidisciplinary Association for Psychedelic Studies (
 MAPS). His professional goal is to help develop legal contexts for the ben
 eficial uses of psychedelics and marijuana\, primarily as prescription med
 icines but also for personal growth for otherwise healthy people\, and eve
 ntually to become a legally licensed psychedelic therapist. He founded MAP
 S in 1986.
LOCATION:Hot Docs Cinema
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/prophet-of-ecstasy-with-rick-doblin-toro
 nto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
