BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ubi is Wild Pride Merch Is So Good It Keeps Selling Out
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T120000
UID:blogto-237010@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/25/original_image08fd8b20-b9fe-49b9-b5f9-baa48b5b1e
 5d.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Tubi Pride Merch Goes Viral as Fans Rush to Grab Sold-Out Coll
 ection\nTubi has found unexpected success this Pride season with a bold an
 d humorous merchandise collection that has quickly gone viral across socia
 l media. The free streaming platform's LGBTQ+ Pride merchandise gained wid
 espread attention after popular entertainment account PopCrave shared imag
 es of the collection\, sparking excitement among fans.\nThe collection fea
 tures a variety of playful items inspired by Tubi's signature purple-and-y
 ellow branding. Among the standout pieces are a yellow harness with purple
  “Tubi” lettering\, a tank top reading “Proud Tubi Gay\,” basketba
 ll shorts emblazoned with the word “Free\,” and a matching baseball ca
 p. The line also includes several tongue-in-cheek designs\, including a sh
 irt that says “You Can Watch For Free” and another referencing Tubi Or
 iginals in the platform’s trademark comedic style.\nSocial media users q
 uickly embraced the collection\, praising the company for creating Pride m
 erchandise that feels authentic\, entertaining\, and tailored to its audie
 nce. Many users expressed frustration that several items sold out almost i
 mmediately after launch\, with some comparing the online shopping experien
 ce to securing tickets for a major event.\nThe collection was designed by 
 creative designer Cole Poska\, known online as @SpaceboyCole. Poska announ
 ced the launch through social media\, revealing that Tubi had invited him 
 back to create an official Pride collection. The initial release was follo
 wed by a second merchandise drop that reportedly sold out within minutes\,
  further fueling online buzz.\nFans noted that the merchandise perfectly r
 eflects Tubi’s playful brand identity. The streaming service has built a
  reputation for its humorous social media presence and its ability to conn
 ect with younger audiences through memes\, pop culture references\, and se
 lf-aware marketing.\nThe successful launch also arrives during a period wh
 en some companies have scaled back their Pride campaigns due to political 
 and cultural backlash. In contrast\, Tubi has continued to celebrate LGBTQ
 + audiences while maintaining its distinctive sense of humor.\nBeyond the 
 merchandise itself\, many fans highlighted Tubi’s extensive catalog of L
 GBTQ+ films and independent queer cinema. The platform remains a popular d
 estination for viewers seeking diverse and hard-to-find queer stories\, ma
 king the Pride collection feel like a natural extension of its ongoing sup
 port for the community.
LOCATION:Multiple Venues
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/ubi-is-wild-pride-merch-is-so-good-it-ke
 eps-selling-out-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
