BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tubi Pride Merch Trucker Hat
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260629T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260629T130000
UID:blogto-237012@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/25/original_image37e3ffef-6210-41b3-85e1-1886800c76
 eb.jpg
DESCRIPTION:ubi perfectly honest\, this Pride merch slaps.\nThe LGBTQ+ Pri
 de merchandise from free streaming site Tubi has gone viral after being sh
 ared by stan account turned Gen-Z New York Times\, PopCrave.\nRead the bes
 t of what's queer curated by us.\nSIGN UP\nBy signing up\, you agree to ou
 r user agreement (including class action waiver and arbitration provisions
 )\, and acknowledge our privacy policy.\nThe image shared by PopCrave incl
 uded a yellow harness with purple lettering saying “Tubi” — the bran
 d’s signature color palette — as well as a tank top that says “Proud
  Tubi Gay” and basketball shorts that say “Free.”\nThat’s not all 
 that’s in their cheeky Pride line\, either. Per their merch website\, th
 e collection includes a shirt that says\, “I Got My A$$ Ate While Watchi
 ng a Tubi Original\,” a shirt that reads “You Can Watch For Free” an
 d a “Proud Tubi Gay” baseball cap. There is also — because of course
  there is — a purple jockstrap that says “FREE” on the waistband.\nT
 rending Now\nCan 10 Masc Lesbians Agree On Dating?\nSocial media users are
  loving the brand’s fresh\, fun take on LGBTQ+ Pride merch at a time whe
 n many companies are forswearing the holiday altogether.\n“They need to 
 give these to the people who’ve actually watched countless terrible low 
 budget gay movies on Tubi\, some of us have been in the trenches\,” one 
 person wrote on X. official website https://www.bonfire.com/tubi-pride-mer
 chandise/\nMany pleaded with Tubi for more merch. “How is anyone going t
 o be able to get merch if everything is sold out i really wanted the you c
 an watch for free shirt @tubi\,” another person wrote.\nThe merch was ma
 de by Cole Poska\, who goes by the handle @SpaceboyCole on social media. P
 oska has designed merch for Tubi before. In an Instagram post issued last 
 week\, he previewed the collection\, alongside the caption:\n“@tubi came
  back for seconds\, and this time they let me design their Pride merch! th
 e Proud Tubi Gay collection launches today at 1PM EST on ProudTubiGay.com\
 ,” he wrote. “And as always\, it’s all free! More surprises are comi
 ng June 23 👀 Grab them while you can\, because you.”\nAdvertisement\n
 Poska followed up with a second post on Tuesday announcing a second drop o
 f official merch that opened that same day and apparently sold out within 
 minutes.\n“Made it to the last part of filling out my info THREE TIMES b
 efore the harness was snatched away from my cart each time\,” one person
  wrote.\n“You know the merch is good when the checkout process gave Tick
 etmaster war\,” another wrote.\nTubi’s pride merch reflects the brand
 ’s overall tongue-in-cheek social media presence and brand identity\, in
 cluding tweeting out a picture of Tiffany “New York” Pollard wearing a
  Knicks Hat to comment on the fourth game in the NBA finals or its constan
 t (friendly) reminders that\, as a completely free service\, it is the peo
 ple’s princess of streaming services.\nTubi’s tongue-in-cheek merch st
 ands out at a time when\, due to political backlash\, many brands have aba
 ndoned their LGBTQ+ Pride affiliations. Of course\, many brands\, such as 
 Levi’s and REI — and\, of course\, Tubi — have not caved to politica
 l pressure and continue to create LGBTQ+ collections.\nBut it also sticks 
 out because Tubi clearly knows its audience. Known for having a vast libra
 ry\, Tubi boasts an incredibly extensive list of LGBTQ+ titles\, as well\,
  with it being a storehouse for many queer and trans indie films that are 
 not widely available. For example\, one Letterboxd list of all the queer f
 ilms currently on Tubi goes on for 9 full pages\, with around 100 entries 
 per page.
LOCATION:Multiple Venues
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/tubi-pride-merch-trucker-hat-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
