 ght of trivia dedicated to one of BookTok’s most beloved love stories.\n
 Join us at Hemingway’s on Wednesday\, June 17th for Heated Rivalry Trivi
 a!\nFrom unforgettable tension and secret meetups to iconic quotes\, emoti
 onal moments\, hockey chaos\, and everything between Shane and Ilya\, this
  trivia night is designed for the viewers who became completely obsessed w
 ith this fan favourite romance. Whether you flew through the season in one
  sitting or still think about it daily\, this is your chance to prove your
  Heated Rivalry knowledge.\nGather your team\, enjoy great food and drinks
 \, and prepare for a night full of laughs\, feelings\, and competitive ene
 rgy worthy of the NHL.\nThis trivia is on the Heated Rivalry TV Series onl
 y!\nThis is the SECOND NIGHT of Heated Rivalry Trivia. If you attended the
  first evening on Wednesday\, June 17th\, your tickets will be refunded.\n
 TRIVIA DETAILS\n🕕 Doors open at 6:00 PM. Arrive early\, grab a themed d
 rink\, and get settled in.\n❓ First question at 7:00 PM sharp. Don’t b
 e late.\n🧠 Three rounds of trivia\, about 15 questions each.\n🏆 The 
