 09.jpg
DESCRIPTION:First Wednesday of Every Month\n8PM @ Super Wonder Gallery— 
 1162 Bloor St. W.\nInspired by the legendary late 80's Toronto dance night
  at The Empire\, Psychedelic Wednesdays is a low-key\, non-pretentious psy
 chedelic dance party at Super Wonder Gallery.\nExpect a heavy dose of 60s/
 70s psychedelic rock\, acid rock\, funk\, soul\, deep cuts\, oddities\, cl
 assics\, and whatever else feels right in the moment. Hendrix\, Floyd\, Th
 e Doors\, Funkadelic\, Grateful Dead\, disco\, and “Black Betty” for s
 ome reason… It's all fair game\, man.\nThis is not a strict museum-piece
  recreation of psychedelic music culture. It’s more like: “dance like 
 you’re in high school on acid in 1988.”\nMusic starts around 8PM and g
 oes until at least midnight.\nGood music. Good Dancing. Good weirdness.
LOCATION:Super Wonder Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/psychedelic-wednesdays-toronto/
