BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Killer B Cinema Presents: Banglar Superman!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260703T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260703T223000
UID:blogto-236629@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/16/original_image7bc7cc37-9f9b-4c2b-92ba-e15518bcd8
 60.jpg
DESCRIPTION:It’s a bird! It’s a plane! It’s Banglar Superman! Join u
 s on July 3rd for a Superman you’ve never seen before! Oh\, and there is
  dancing!\nAdvanced tickets are $5\; tickets at the door are $8 (Space is 
 limited\, and tickets sell out fast)!\nTicket Link: https://www.eventbrite
 .ca/e/1991276454479?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDoors open at 7:30 pm\, and the mov
 ie begins at 8:00.\n*NO outside food or drinks\; please buy food and drink
 s from the venue.\n*All films have closed captioning.\nMovie info:\nIn thi
 s gloriously unauthorized Bangladeshi superhero spectacular\, young Robin 
 is blasted to Earth just before General Zod\, Ursa\, and a suspicious Klin
 gon named Non capture his parents. Raised by a Christian missionary and gi
 fted with superhuman powers\, Robin must save the world\, rescue his famil
 y\, romance the mysterious jungle woman Sheila\, and somehow squeeze sever
 al musical numbers into the middle of an interplanetary crisis. Featuring 
 Video Toaster flying effects\, delightfully deranged cosmic villains\, and
  enough copyright violations to make a lawyer spontaneously combust\, Bang
 lar Superman is a bona fide cult-cinema treasure not to be missed.\nBangal
  Superman has been captioned exclusively by Killer B Cinema. You won’t s
 ee another version of it elsewhere!\nBangal Superman stars Danny Sidak\, N
 uton\, Nasir Khan\, and is directed by Iftekhar Jahan.\nInfo about See-Sca
 pe:\nOur movies will be shown on the second floor! There are two bars avai
 lable in See-Scape. The bar on the second floor is open during our event a
 nd is cash-only. Debit/Credit purchases are available on the main floor.\n
 See-Scape also has an amazing menu. To learn more about See-Scape\, please
  click here! https://www.seescapeto.com/\nSee-Scape is located at 347 Keel
 e Street (the closest intersection is Keele/Dundas) and is easily accessib
 le via TTC. (from Keele Station or Dundas West Station)\nParking: There is
  a Green P parking lot beside See-Scape and a few other paid parking lots 
 nearby.\nEach month\, join Lizzie Violet & Zoltan Du Lac for killer B-move
 s from the 1930s to the present!\nPlease like our Facebook page and Instag
 ram @killerbcinema so you don’t miss an invite.\nThank you to See-Scape 
 and their staff! They make our monthly event extra unforgettable!\nWe hope
  to see you at See-Scape.
