BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seasons of Souls - Keir Collective
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260703T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260703T213000
UID:blogto-236254@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/08/original_image9985fff4-c7ed-4f39-9645-d4f6b93c80
 51.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Seasons of Souls - Keir Collective\nToronto Fringe Festival 20
 26\nFactory Theatre Mainspace | July 3–11\, 2026\nCreated by the award-w
 inning team behind the 2024 Toronto Fringe Patron's Pick *Scenes From An I
 talian Restaurant* and the 2025 Best of Fringe production *The Iron Mask*\
 , *Seasons of Souls* is the debut production of Keir Collective.\nRooted i
 n contemporary ballet and cinematic movement storytelling\, this original 
 contemporary dance work explores transformation\, resilience\, grief\, joy
 \, connection\, and renewal through athletic choreography and immersive th
 eatricality. Centered around the concept of time\, Seasons of Souls asks a
  universal question: how do we spend our time\, and do we ever truly have 
 enough of it?\nFeaturing a dynamic cast of Toronto-based artists\, Seasons
  of Souls blends powerful movement\, evocative imagery\, and emotionally d
 riven storytelling into a visually striking theatrical experience.\nPerfor
 mance Dates\nJuly 3 – 8:30 PM\nJuly 4 – 12:30 PM\nJuly 5 – 3:30 PM\n
 July 7 – 9:15 PM\nJuly 9 – 5:45 PM\nJuly 10 – 10:00 PM\nJuly 11 – 
 6:45 PM\nVenue\nFactory Theatre Mainspace\n125 Bathurst Street\, Toronto\n
 Tickets: $15–20 (Toronto Fringe Festival pricing)\nFor tickets and more 
 information\, visit: https://fringetoronto.com/fringe/show/seasons-souls
LOCATION:Factory Theatre Mainspace
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/seasons-of-souls-keir-collective-toronto
 /
X-SOURCE:blogTO
