 m July 3 to July 26.\nThe Festival takes place across a number of venues\;
  stage concerts are held in several different parks within the area and al
 so along a two-kilometer stretch of the Beach main street during StreetFes
 t - Queen Street East.\nEvery year\, the Festival brings in internationall
 y acclaimed jazz performers while also showcasing local talent\, including
  "new generation" jazz musicians. \nThe Festival offers concerts at vario
 us locations: the Woodbine Park Main Stage\, Jimmie Simpson Park Main Stag
