BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CosmicWander: Expedition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260704T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260704T170000
UID:blogto-237072@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/25/original_image12a50097-9935-4194-a535-d89698b4c6
 52.jpg
DESCRIPTION:CosmicWander is an ongoing project by Choy that explores shama
 nic and folk dance cultures in Asia and which traverses the process of wor
 lding across different communities. Having ventured into the region in sea
 rch of trance experiences\, the artist has met over 50 shamans and documen
 ted dance rituals ranging from collective trance in Siberia to mythologica
 l practices in Java. CosmicWander: Expedition presents Choy’s research t
 o-date\, through a major solo exhibition that presents varied perspectives
  on humanity’s attempt to connect\, to question\, and to perceive and in
 teract with different states of realities through ritualistic practices. S
 tories and images composed from his encounters with altered states are int
 erwoven with the artist’s own speculations\, to offer a choreographic se
 quence of material inspired by practices observed in Singapore\, Indonesia
 \, Siberia\, Taiwan\, Vietnam and Bhutan.
LOCATION:918 Bathurst
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/cosmicwander-expedition-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
