 cenes\, and unique experiences—together. We handle the curation\; you ju
 st bring your partner and your appetite and dine with other like-minded co
 uples to great conversation and unforgettable nights out.\nEXPERIENCE A SU
 MMER PATIO DINNER!\nPlease join us at Chula Taberna Mexicana for a patio n
 ight under the sky\, and a taste of Mexican fusion in Lesliville.\nWe have
  a secured a designated space on their patio for this unique dinner\, so w
 e can enjoy some Margaritas under the stars :-)\nChula's philosophy is ref
 lected in their cuisine and mixology\, with its homage to Mexican traditio
