 biceps of the College Promenade neighbourhood.\nOn this walk\, we’ll exp
 lore this lively stretch of College Street known for its nightlife\, recre
 ation\, and local landmarks\, from the West End YMCA to the iconic Matador
  Club. We’ll revel in the area’s historic music scene while hearing st
 ories of gathering and change\, from its early history and the now-buried 
