DESCRIPTION:Experience raw\, fiery\, and improvisational spirit of flamenc
 o at Toronto's iconic Monarch Tavern\nABOUT THE SHOW\nExperience the raw\,
  wild\, and deeply improvisational nature of flamenco at Toronto's histori
 c venue\, the Monarch Tavern. Acoustic and unamplified\, come see flamenco
  at its purest\, most intense and most thrilling. Modelled off the flamenc
 o tablaos in Granada\, nestled into caves in the city's hillside\, this is
  flamenco as it is performed in Spain: improvised and dynamic.\nLet everyt
 hing else slip away and experience flamenco as it is rarely seen outside o
 f Spain.\nTIME\nDoors open at 7pm\nShow starts at 8pm\nCome early to get t
 he best seat! Stay for the flamenco party at the end.
