 90.jpg
DESCRIPTION:As we rocket from station to station\, explore the art that ad
 orns Toronto’s subway system.\nHop on the TTC with us and discover the m
 urals\, mosaics\, and designs hidden in plain sight.\nOur subway stations 
 are not just critical infrastructure for public transportation. They are a
 lso dynamic sites for cultural and artistic expression. On this tour\, we
 ’ll explore the 70+ year history of public art in Toronto’s transit la
 ndscape\, from station architecture and design\, to forgotten tilework of 
 the 1950s\, to the contemporary murals of today.
