BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Emo/Punk Trivia
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260706T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260706T220000
UID:blogto-236462@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/12/original_imagebfce752e-e813-472d-acfa-71fadece1b
 c6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Can you tell your MCR from your Fall Out Boy? Test your knowle
 dge of emo\, pop-punk\, and scene-era anthems\nBreak out the eyeliner\, du
 st off your band tees\, and prepare for a trip back to the golden age of a
 ngst.\nJoin us for Emo/Punk Trivia\, a night dedicated to the bands\, albu
 ms\, lyrics\, and unforgettable moments that defined a generation. From My
  Chemical Romance and Fall Out Boy to Paramore\, Blink-182\, Avril Lavigne
 \, Green Day\, Panic! At The Disco\, and more\, we'll be covering the musi
 c that lived on your iPod and your MySpace profile.\nWhether you were an e
 mo kid\, a pop-punk devotee\, or just really passionate about Warped Tour\
 , this trivia night is your chance to prove it.\nCome sing along\, relive 
 the drama\, and see if you're still not okay 🖤🎶🤘\nTRIVIA DETAILS\
