 st friends and compete in a night of fast paced pub trivia at Hemingway’
 s.\nJoin us on Wednesday\, July 8th for a night of Pub Trivia hosted by Al
 most Jeopardy!\nFrom pop culture\, movies\, and music to sports\, history\
 , internet chaos\, and completely random facts you forgot your brain store
 d away\, this game covers a little bit of everything. Whether you are a se
 asoned trivia regular or just looking for a fun night out with friends\, t
 his is your chance to put your knowledge to the test.\nExpect quick thinki
 ng\, friendly competition\, great food and drinks\, and a packed room full
  of teams battling for bragging rights and gift cards.\nHOW IT WORKS\n3 Ro
 unds\, 10 Questions each\nRound 1: General Knowledge - anything goes!\nRou
 nd 2: Theme Round - a new theme is announced each week @AlmostJeopardy so 
 study up!\nRound 3: Almost Jeopardy?* Round - two sets of five questions i
 nspired by our favourite game show\nFinal Question - It all comes down to 
 this: bet your points on one last question. Our glorious winners will be c
 rowned smartest team in the room and you'll walk away with great prizes fr
 om Hemingway's.\n* not affiliated with the show in any way\, obviously\nTR
 IVIA DETAILS\n🕕 Doors open at 6:00 PM. Arrive early\, grab a themed dri
 nk\, and get settled in.\n❓ First question at 7:00 PM sharp. Don’t be 
