DESCRIPTION:Heritage Skills Development Centre (HSDC) warmly invites you t
 o join our upcoming community dialogue: From Microaggression to Action: Un
 derstanding the Law and Building Safer Workplaces: Know Your Rights. Name 
 the Harm. Take Action. The session will conduct on Thursday\, July 9\, 202
 6\, from 4:00 – 5:30 PM on Zoom.\n\nWorkplace microaggressions and haras
 sment can have lasting impacts on individuals\, teams\, and organizational
  culture. Yet many employees are uncertain about their rights\, reporting 
 options\, and the resources available when concerns arise.\n\nJoin us for 
 this timely and informative discussion featuring an employment lawyer and 
 DEI consultants\, who will share practical knowledge and strategies to hel
 p participants:\n\nUnderstand workplace harassment and discrimination laws
  in Ontario\nLearn how to document and report incidents effectively\nExplo
 re options when internal reporting systems are unavailable or ineffective\
 nDiscover legal and community resources available to support victims\nBuil
 d confidence to advocate for themselves and others\n\nWhether you are an e
