 is dialogue will provide valuable information to help create safer and mor
 e respectful workplaces for all. Please register here: https://forms.gle/i
 KwEvoFn7DmA11x58\n\nPlease see the attached flyer and feel free to share t
 his invitation with your colleagues\, friends\, and networks. Together\, w
 e can move from awareness to action and build workplaces rooted in dignity
 \, safety\, and respect.\n\nParticipants who attend the session will be en
 tered into a raffle draw for a chance to win an e-gift card! We look forwa
 rd to having you join us for this important conversation.
LOCATION:Virtual Event
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/join-our-community-consultation-know-you
 r-rights-name-the-harm-take-action-july-9-toronto-2/
