 s. Bring a date. Bring the kids. Show up alone and stay the whole afternoo
 n. It's that kind of weekend.\nAward winning dance crews from across the c
 ountry\, food vendors lining the square\, local artisans selling their wor
 k\, DJs running it all weekend. This is what summer in North York looks li
 ke.\nEvent Highlights Include:\nCanada K-Pop Dance Championship featuring 
