 atin Ballroom Dance Champions Show\nAerial Artists Suspending Silk Dance S
 how\nSalsa & Bachata Social Dance Party\nDJs spinning all weekend\nKids Wo
 nderland - with FREE family games and giveaways\nFood vendors and street f
 ood from across Toronto\nLocal artisans and small business pop-ups\nK-Pop 
 competition on Saturday\, the Star Dance Centre Showcase on Sunday\, and a
  food market that turns the square into one big block party both days.\nAd
 mission is FREE. Full schedule at www.danceonyonge.com.
