BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Grown-ups Reading Children's Literature Book Club:  Wind in the Wi
 llows
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260711T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260711T160000
UID:blogto-236184@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/06/original_image5a3b7489-9233-4009-a270-696f1eeebc
 0b.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the monthly meeting of Osborne Collection's Book C
 lub. In July we will be discussing Wind in the Willows by Kenneth Grahame.
 \nGrown-ups Reading Children's Literature Book Club is for adult readers w
 ho enjoy children's books. Revisit favourite stories of your childhood or 
