 gto.com/events/2026/06/23/original_image66de049d-839b-4c9f-bc6b-dddb4f081f
 37.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The agents who changed the game.\nJoin ICFF for a special scre
 ening of The American Dream\, a compelling story that explores ambition\, 
 identity\, and the shifting meaning of success in today’s world.\nSet ag
 ainst the backdrop of modern life and the pursuit of opportunity\, the fil
 m follows characters whose hopes and choices are shaped by the promise and
  pressure of “the American Dream.” As their lives intertwine\, long-he
 ld beliefs about success\, belonging\, and sacrifice are challenged\, reve
 aling how fragile and complex that dream can be.\nThe American Dream invit
 es audiences to reflect on what it truly means to build a life\, and at wh
 at cost. The film moves between moments of aspiration and reality\, captur
 ing the emotional tension between where we come from and where we hope to 
 go.\nDon’t miss this thought-provoking cinematic experience that examine
 s identity\, resilience\, and the pursuit of a better future\, asking a ti
 meless question: is the dream still the same for everyone who chases it?
