 tching\, layering\, blending\, and building highlights and shadows to crea
 te realism and vibrancy. You’ll learn time-honoured oil painting techniq
 ues with supportive guidance throughout.\nGuided Instruction:\nLearn found
 ational oil painting methods from an experienced artist—from initial ske
 tch to final detail work—using layering\, glazing\, and observation of l
