 65.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Come sit with Azaria for an evening of demystifying the craft.
  If you have ever felt a pull toward the occult but didn’t know where to
  start\, this foundational workshop is your gateway. We strip away the Hol
 lywood myths and focus on the core mechanics of witchcraft\, energy manipu
 lation\, and personal sovereignty. You will learn how to ground your energ
 y\, set iron-clad spiritual boundaries\, and tap into your innate power to
  manifest a life aligned with your truest desires.\nInvestment: $60 per in
 dividual session\nExperience: Entry to the immersive\, 2-hour in-person wo
 rkshop with personalized guidance from Azaria the Alchemist for the group\
 nLive Energy Healing: Integrated collective energy work and alignment duri
 ng the session to clear blocks and anchor your manifestations.\nBottomless
  Tea Service: Warm\, comforting tea poured throughout the entire experienc
 e to keep you grounded and nourished.\nThe Physical Workbook: A comprehens
 ive\, booklet packed with the session's lessons\, worksheets\, and resourc
 es to guide your practice at home.\nAudio Access: A high-quality digital a
 udio recording of the live lesson\, sent directly to your resource folder 
 so you can listen back and learn at your own pace.\nImportant Note: To get
  the absolute most out of this series\, please bring your exact birth deta
 ils (time\, date\, and city of birth) or a printed copy of your birth char
 t to every session.\nIf you don't know your exact birth time\, don't worry
 ! You can absolutely still participate\, and we will work with your birth 
 date and city to give you a powerful general understanding of your cosmic 
 energy so you can confidently move forward.\nDisclaimer: All services\, re
 adings\, sessions\, workshops\, and materials provided by Azaria\, HELEN +
  HILDEGARD and Azaria’s Alchemy are intended for entertainment and perso
 nal exploration only. They are not a substitute for professional\, medical
 \, legal\, or psychological advice. No outcomes are guaranteed\, and parti
 cipants/clients are fully responsible for their own choices\, actions\, an
 d interpretations. By engaging with any work or content\, you acknowledge 
