BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2nd Edition of Agriculture\, Forestry\, and Horticulture World Con
 ference 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260720T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260720T180000
UID:blogto-232802@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/03/28/original_image2b612d4e-a728-4f7d-9519-1a6de0b92d
 0d.jpg
DESCRIPTION:2nd Edition of Agriculture\, Forestry\, and Horticulture World
  Conference 2026\nPrecision Global Conferences cordially invite you to the
  2nd Edition of Agriculture\, Forestry\, and Horticulture World Conference
  (AFHWC) 2026\, scheduled from July 20 to 22\, 2026. The conference will b
 e conducted in a hybrid format in Singapore and virtually.\nThe theme of t
 he Agricultural conference is " Thriving Earth: Agriculture\, Forestry\, a
 nd Horticulture for a Sustainable World.”\n\nThe 2nd Edition of Agricult
 ure\, Forestry\, and Horticulture World Conference (AFHWC) 2026 is poised 
 to be a groundbreaking conference scheduled to take place in Singapore fro
 m July 20-22\, 2026. This conference is dedicated to exploring the world o
 f agriculture\, forestry\, and horticulture\, uniting leading researchers\
 , experts\, policymakers\, and practitioners. This conference provides an 
 excellent platform for the participants to discuss their experiences and s
 hare their knowledge in these fields.\nThe conference presents opportuniti
 es for participants to engage in diverse programs\, including captivating 
 presentations\, seminars\, and workshops. Attendees can explore advanced a
 gricultural\, forestry\, horticulture\, and associated domains. This confe
 rence aims to provide a deeper understanding of innovative technologies us
 ed in agricultural engineering\, forest management\, and maintenance of ho
 rticultural crops.\nParticipants can anticipate an exclusive opportunity t
