BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Singles Event: Women --50 and up-- & Men --all ages--
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260721T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260721T210000
UID:blogto-236772@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/19/original_image95810f7f-5add-49a8-93de-fcaa9dc6b9
 7c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:PLEASE READ FULL DESCRIPTION BELOW\nSEVERAL OF OUR PAST EVENTS
  WERE SOLD OUT! During our events\, people have had so much fun that they 
 stayed behind after the event to have dinner/drinks with several of the at
 tendees as a group! This singles speed mixer will combine the elements of 
 speed dating and also a social mixer. Bring your business cards as this is
  also an opportunity for networking and meeting new friends. Please note t
 hat this event is open to all ages of men.\nWe will start with free time f
 or mingling followed by a few rounds of a group icebreaker activity and ga
 mes. Attendees will then have a few rounds of 7 minutes to chat with anyon
 e of their choice and at the sound of the bell will select another person 
 to chat with. It is better than speed dating as you are not obligated to s
 it and speak with all attendees! No need to be nervous\, just remember tha
 t everyone is in the same boat. All you have to do is show up and just sta
 rt talking to anyone even someone of the same gender! Come with an open mi
 nd and positive outlook as you never know who you may meet and where it ma
 y go.\nTICKET INCLUDES AN ALCOHOLIC/NON-ALCOHOLIC DRINK.\nAttendees are en
 couraged to exchange contacts at the event but there will also be pieces o
 f paper for attendees to write down names of those who they are interested
  in and can hand it into the host afterwards. who will then send an email 
 to the attendee enquiring if there is a mutual interest. If there is found
  to be mutual interest then the person's contact information will be share
 d with you with their consent. (If you are asked for your contact informat
 ion at the event but do not feel a romantic vibe with the person\, you can
  always let them know that you would be happy to exchange contacts but tha
 t you feel more of a friendship vibe).***Often emails from the host to att
 endees are blocked\, Hotmail is notorious for this\, therefore participant
 s are strongly encouraged to exchange contacts at the event itself.\nFeel 
 free to provide honest feedback to the host so future events and attendees
  can benefit.\nDress to impress! No extremely casual clothing.\nThe event 
 will start promptly so please arrive early. Parking can be found in nearby
  parking lots and side streets.\nIf the gender ratio is very unbalanced\, 
 the event will be postponed. Please check your email (including spam/junk 
 inboxes) a day before the event and also after the event for important upd
 ates and information. Emails regarding event info and also connecting with
  individuals post-event often goes to people's junk boxes! If you did not 
 receive pre-event emails from us\, please contact us at TorontoGTAsingles@
 gmail.com.\nAs the gender ratio is controlled\, we will admit people witho
 ut a ticket at the door only if they have been accepted to do so in advanc
 e.\n***Please email us at TorontoGTAsingles@gmail.com prior to showing up 
 at the door to make sure you will be accepted. There is important informat
 ion that is provided prior to the event that must be read before attending
 .\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------
 ---------------------\nThere are 3 options for staying up-to-date on event
 s:\n1. Follow the page on facebook for updates "TorontoGTAsingles" and joi
 n of one the groups:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/groups/4598240670401181 for
  the ages 50+ group or https://www.facebook.com/groups/1118178702580538 fo
