 gto.com/events/2026/06/16/original_image92949b8f-e1d4-43f3-a912-a95e15e9d8
 42.jpg
DESCRIPTION:We are thrilled to have Project Grizzly back at Hot Docs Cinem
 a! This screening is being re-presented due to the epic blizzard which sno
 wed out our last showing in January.\nAn inventor goes face to face with C
 anada’s most deadly land mammal\, the grizzly bear\, in this Canadian cl
 assic that gained cult status\, not to mention praise from director Quenti
 n Tarantino and a loving parody on The Simpsons. After creating what he ho
 pes is a grizzly-proof robo suit\, Troy James Hurtubise ventures into Albe
 rta’s Rocky Mountains on a quixotic quest to face a grizzly bear\, testi
 ng his armour—and courage— along the way.\nJoin director Peter Lynch f
 or a special post-screening Q&A.\nFilm provided courtesy of the National F
 ilm Board of Canada (NFB).
LOCATION:Hot Docs Ted Rogers Cinema
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/project-grizzly-30th-anniversary-toronto
 -2/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
