 gto.com/events/2026/06/10/original_image05a35f12-7dab-4330-b2bf-82333fde6f
 f3.jpg
DESCRIPTION:“Dreams shift and change\, but we keep moving forward”. Th
 is is the mantra that our cast and crew have been living by as they worked
  together to create this new show that gives a spotlight to the actors and
  not only the adversity they face\, but also how they overcome and rise ab
 ove it.\nJoin us on August 21st and 28 at 6 pm and 8:30 pm at Aki Studios 
 for a magical night filled with stories and songs spanning 5 decades of th
 eatre that highlight the bravery\, resilience\, and growth that come with 
 pursuing your dreams.\nHosted by a newly formed indie theatre company\, KL
 ASSE Theatrical Productions\, in 2025\, our sole purpose is to help spotli
 ght more up-and-coming Canadian performers. We’re redefining what it mea
 ns to “belong” in theatre.
LOCATION:Aki Studio Theatre
