 12.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Step into the past and taste your way through history! In this
  immersive 8-week cooking workshop\, participants will explore the bizarre
 \, bold\, and beautiful flavors of bygone eras. From ancient Roman delicac
 ies to jellied wonders of the 1970s\, each session dives into a different 
 time period with hands-on cooking\, historical anecdotes\, and plenty of l
 aughs. Whether you're a history buff\, a foodie\, or just curious about wh
 at people used to eat\, this program promises a deliciously educational ad
 venture.
LOCATION:Dorsay Community & Heritage Centre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/time-travelling-tastes-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
